 libcafe-slab-dev - beautification app library (development headers)
 libcafe-slab0 - beautification app library
 libcafe-window-settings-dev - utilities to configure the CAFE desktop (window settings headers)
 libcafe-window-settings1 - utilities to configure the CAFE desktop (window settings library)
